wing gold• Added a Portal Generator funded with resources and gold• Added the new introductory quest, “Where am I?”• Completing the introduction unlocks additional NPC quests• Campaign quest progress is now shared across the party using the hos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:34:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672664","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928980-1846018067942038","game_id":"steam-4928980","kind":"announcement","title":"The Climb It Up Announcement Trailer Is Here! 🧗","summary":"Climbers, our new trailer is here! 🧗 While we continue working on new features, improvements and more content for Climb It Up, we wanted to share something new with you: 🎬 THE CLIMB IT UP ANNOUNCEMENT TRAILER IS NOW LIVE! ▶️ Watch it here: Climb It Up is a co-op dungeon crawler built around climbing, exploration, teamwork and adventure. Development is still moving forward behind the scenes, and we’re working on new features and improvements that we can’t wait to show you. A huge thank you to eve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:55:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942038","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4928980-1845383656394920","game_id":"steam-4928980","kind":"announcement","title":"Climb It Up Public Demo Is Live!","summary":"Climbers, the wait is over!The Climb It Up Public Demo is now available on Steam for everyone to play.Thank you to everyone who participated in our private playtests, reported bugs, shared feedback and helped us improve the game. A lot has changed thanks to you, and this public demo comes with another major update.🏕️ THE NEW EXPEDITION HUBA brand-new Expedition Hub is now available!The Hub is your new home between adventures, where you can prepare for future expeditions and interact with new cha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T00:15:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394920","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:50:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4928980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4928980":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4928980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z"},"5331920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:17:26Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4928980","app_id":4928980,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e0e44edb2879f31a17cfc652e808e5f00c9ec1cbc8273fe8b496af0acb3a2ae4","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Climb It Up is a chaotic solo/4-player co-op climbing dungeon game. Dolphin-jump, climb, swing with grappling hooks, choose powerful rewards, fight corrupted enemies, and try not to drag your friends into the abyss.","publishers":[{"name":"TeamBravo"}],"developers":[{"name":"TeamBravo"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon","is_early